  "result": "Perfect! All 355 tests pass. The renderInvoiceText function has been successfully enhanced. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Enhanced Invoice Rendering\n\n**Improvements to renderInvoiceText()**:\n\n**New Features Added**:\n1. **Line Discounts**: Shows discount for each line that has one (line discount or bulk discount)\n   - Format: `(discount: \u20acX.XX)` appended to line details\n   - Only shown if discount amount > 0\n\n2. **Voucher Display**: Shows voucher line before total\n   - Format: `Voucher: \u20acX.XX`\n   - Only shown if voucher applied (amount > 0)\n\n3. **Due Date**: Shows payment due date for issued invoices\n   - Format: `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`\n   - Only shown for issued invoices (have a number)\n\n4. **Payment Tracking**: Shows total amount paid so far\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20acX.XX`\n   - Only shown if payments exist (total paid > 0)\n\n**Output Order**:\n1. Invoice number or DRAFT\n2. Customer name\n3. Line items (with discount annotations if applicable)\n4. VAT (if any)\n5. Voucher (if any)\n6. Total\n7. Due date (if issued)\n8. Paid amount (if payments exist)\n\n**Tests Added**: 11 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Line discounts display\n- Bulk discounts display\n- Voucher display\n- Due date display (issued vs draft)\n- Payment display\n- Omission of features when not applicable\n- Correct ordering of all elements\n- All features combined in one invoice\n\n**Test Results**: 355 tests passing (up from 344).",
